 un ritorno alla vita, una presa definitiva di contatto con la realtà."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Adventures of Pinocchio","overview":"Mastro Geppetto is a poor carpenter with no wife and no children. The man is very lonely, and after trading a piece of wood with his colleague Mastro Ciliegia, decides to build himself a puppet to keep him company."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9D02hsrYot66bUyaVDBo1bzj3lM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1gAIPtpuHSYWJ6PjF8r9jOJdSmG.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":58451,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9D02hsrYot66bUyaVDBo1bzj3lM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9D02hsrYot66bUyaVDBo1bzj3lM.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9D02hsrYot66bUyaVDBo1bzj3lM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9D02hsrYot66bUyaVDBo1bzj3lM.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bpRjLfH1pUhHi7zpu2C4wIWw7kQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bpRjLfH1pUhHi7zpu2C4wIWw7kQ.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vlwvcIkFRQZwlNnCgoSPR7fRZk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vlwvcIkFRQZwlNnCgoSPR7fRZk.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pm98OTVOpNcO0ZFJN4jVsqCT3Al.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pm98OTVOpNcO0ZFJN4jVsqCT3Al.jpg","language":"it","width":712,"height":1068}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xjoYc9umKoZHTVr2B0uBbn3bCXj.jpg","previewUrl"